            <p>Urticaria, Upper Arm. A predilection for urticaria to occur in pressure-prone areas such as the waistline, axilla, and groin may be observed; however, lesions can develop on any skin surface, including the upper arm shown here. <ext-link xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" ext-link-type="uri" xlink:href="https://dermnetnz.org/images">DermNet New Zealand</ext-link></p>
